# Design Assets Enforcement

**Trigger**: Always active — enforce whenever modifying or creating UI components.

## Core Rule

All UI components must use **React Native Reusables** (shadcn/ui for React Native). Never use raw React Native primitives (`View`, `Text`, `TouchableOpacity`) for UI elements that have a corresponding shadcn component.

## Component Mapping

Use these React Native Reusables components instead of raw RN primitives:

| UI Element | Use | Instead Of |
|-----------|-----|-----------|
| Button | `<Button />` from `@/components/ui/button` | `TouchableOpacity`, `Pressable` |
| Card | `<Card />` from `@/components/ui/card` | `View` with shadow |
| Input | `<Input />` from `@/components/ui/input` | `TextInput` raw styling |
| Label | `<Label />` from `@/components/ui/label` | `Text` with label styles |
| Badge | `<Badge />` from `@/components/ui/badge` | `View` with colored bg |
| Text | `<Text />` with className styling | `Text` with inline styles |
| Dialog/Modal | `@/components/ui/dialog` | `Modal` |
| Toast | `@/components/ui/sonner` or `@/components/ui/toast` | `Alert` |
| Select | `<Select />` from `@/components/ui/select` | `Picker` |
| Switch | `<Switch />` from `@/components/ui/switch` | `Switch` raw |
| Separator | `<Separator />` from `@/components/ui/separator` | `View` with border |
| Avatar | `<Avatar />` from `@/components/ui/avatar` | `Image` with circle |
| Tabs | `<Tabs />` from `@/components/ui/tabs` | Manual tab state |
| Tooltip | `<Tooltip />` from `@/components/ui/tooltip` | Custom tooltip |
| Dropdown Menu | `<DropdownMenu />` from `@/components/ui/dropdown-menu` | Custom popover |
| Progress | `<Progress />` from `@/components/ui/progress` | `View` with width |
| Skeleton | `<Skeleton />` from `@/components/ui/skeleton` | `View` with gray bg |
| Accordion | `<Accordion />` from `@/components/ui/accordion` | Manual expand/collapse |

## Styling Rules

### 1. Use Tailwind Classes via className

```tsx
// GOOD
<View className="flex-1 bg-background p-4">
  <Text className="text-foreground text-lg font-semibold">Title</Text>
</View>

// BAD — raw inline styles
<View style={{ flex: 1, backgroundColor: '#fff', padding: 16 }}>
  <Text style={{ color: '#000', fontSize: 18, fontWeight: '600' }}>Title</Text>
</View>
```

### 2. Use the `cn()` Utility for Conditional Classes

```tsx
import { cn } from "@/lib/utils";

<View className={cn(
  "flex-1 rounded-lg border",
  isActive && "border-primary bg-primary/5",
  className
)} />
```

### 3. Colors Come from CSS Variables (Tokens)

All colors use HSL CSS variables defined in `global.css`. Never hardcode hex/rgb colors.

#### Base Tokens

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-background` | `--background` | Page/canvas background |
| `text-foreground` | `--foreground` | Primary text color |
| `bg-card` | `--card` | Card backgrounds |
| `bg-primary` | `--primary` | Primary actions (Cohere coral #FF7759) |
| `bg-secondary` | `--secondary` | Secondary elements |
| `bg-muted` | `--muted` | De-emphasized content |
| `bg-accent` | `--accent` | Hover/active states |
| `bg-destructive` | `--destructive` | Error/danger states |
| `border-border` | `--border` | Borders |
| `ring-ring` | `--ring` | Focus rings (coral) |

#### Brand Tokens

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-brand` / `bg-brand-500` | `--brand` | Primary brand accent, CTAs |
| `bg-brand-soft` | `--brand-soft` | Soft coral for subtle highlights |

#### Semantic Tokens

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-success` | `--success` | Success states, connected accounts |
| `bg-warning` | `--warning` | Warnings, token expiry |
| `bg-info` | `--info` | Info notifications, queued posts |

#### Chart Colors (Cohere gradient spectrum)

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-chart-c1` to `bg-chart-c10` | `--chart-1` to `--chart-10` | Analytics platform colors |

#### AI Tokens

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-ai-surface` | `--ai-surface` | AI agent surface background |
| `bg-ai-confidence-high` | `--ai-confidence-high` | High confidence badge |
| `bg-ai-confidence-medium` | `--ai-confidence-medium` | Medium confidence badge |
| `bg-ai-confidence-low` | `--ai-confidence-low` | Low confidence badge |

#### Post Status Tokens

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `bg-post-draft` | `--post-draft` | Draft status badge |
| `bg-post-queued` | `--post-queued` | Queued status badge |
| `bg-post-publishing` | `--post-publishing` | Publishing status badge |
| `bg-post-published` | `--post-published` | Published status badge |
| `bg-post-failed` | `--post-failed` | Failed status badge |

#### Compose Form Tokens

| Token | CSS Variable | Usage |
|-------|-------------|-------|
| `text-compose-counter-normal` | `--compose-counter-normal` | Character counter normal |
| `text-compose-counter-warning` | `--compose-counter-warning` | Character counter warning |
| `text-compose-counter-error` | `--compose-counter-error` | Character counter error |
| `border-compose-media-drop-border` | `--compose-media-drop-border` | Media drop zone border |
| `border-compose-media-drop-active` | `--compose-media-drop-active` | Media drop zone active border |

### 4. Use Semantic Tailwind Classes

```tsx
// GOOD — semantic tokens
className="bg-card text-card-foreground rounded-lg border-border"

// BAD — hardcoded colors
className="bg-white text-black rounded-lg border-gray-200"
```

### 5. Border Radius Tokens

```
rounded-sm = calc(var(--radius) - 4px)
rounded-md = calc(var(--radius) - 2px)
rounded-lg = var(--radius)
```

### 6. Spacing Uses Tailwind Scale

Use Tailwind spacing (`p-4`, `gap-2`, `m-6`) — never pixel values. The scale is 0.25rem (4px) based.

## Component Location

All UI components live in:

```
src/components/ui/
  ├── button.tsx
  ├── card.tsx
  ├── input.tsx
  ├── label.tsx
  ├── badge.tsx
  └── ... (add via CLI)
```

Add new components using:

```bash
npx @react-native-reusables/cli@latest add <component-name>
```

## Portal Host

Modal-like components (Dialog, DropdownMenu, Tooltip, Popover) render through `@rn-primitives/portal`. The `<PortalHost />` is already placed in `src/app/_layout.tsx` — do not add another one.

## Dark Mode

Dark mode is automatic via CSS `.dark:root` variables in `global.css`. Components using semantic tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`) adapt automatically. Do not manually detect or switch dark mode in components.

## Accessibility

- Touch targets: minimum `h-11` (44px) height
- Use `aria-label` on icon-only buttons
- Status indicators: always combine color + icon + text (never color alone)
- Focus rings: provided by React Native Reusables — do not remove

## What to Check Before Committing UI Changes

- [ ] No hardcoded color values (hex, rgb, rgba) — use token classes
- [ ] No raw `TouchableOpacity`/`Pressable` where `<Button />` applies
- [ ] No inline `style={{}}` where `className` with Tailwind applies
- [ ] New UI components added via RNR CLI, not hand-written
- [ ] `cn()` used for conditional class merging
- [ ] Touch targets meet 44px minimum
- [ ] Status tokens used correctly (success/warning/info) — no ad-hoc colors
- [ ] Post status badges use `post.*` tokens only
- [ ] Chart colors use `chart.c1`-`c10` only — no custom palettes
- [ ] AI surfaces use `ai-surface` tokens — no hardcoded blues
